OL,3,GNEWSAArts council designation for
OL,4,AThomas Hardy collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum's collection of Thomas Hardy
OL,7,Fmaterial has been awarded Arts Council
OL,8,FEngland (ACE) Designation status.
OL,10,FDorset Museum & Art Gallery in
OL,11,FDorchester is thought to own the
OL,12,Fworld's largest and most important
OL,13,Farchive of the novelist and poet's
OL,14,Fwork.
OL,16,FThe designation "recognises and
OL,17,Fcelebrates collections of national and
OL,18,Finternational importance based on their
OL,19,Fquality and significance".
